+// no intermediate value to be subnormal, which FTZ would flush. Other lanes go to FmaFallback,
+// where ExactFma adds the integer significands. A NaN or infinite input there gets th, the plain
+// sum, except an infinite c with finite a and b: c, although ph may have overflowed. Where a*b is
+// exact (pl = 0, a zero factor for one) the result is th itself.
